      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "737. 把下列各分式写成 $a\\sqrt{b}$ 的形式，其中 $a$ 是有理数，$b$ 是",
        "自然数：",
        "а) $\\frac{5}{\\sqrt{10}}$；　б) $\\frac{7}{\\sqrt{5}}$；　в) $-\\frac{6}{\\sqrt{2}}$；",
        "г) $-\\frac{12}{\\sqrt{3}}$；　д) $\\frac{5}{2\\sqrt{3}}$；　е) $\\frac{21}{5\\sqrt{14}}$；",
        "ж) $-\\frac{3\\sqrt{5}}{\\sqrt{2}}$；　з) $-\\frac{7\\sqrt{6}}{\\sqrt{3}}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "738",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "738. 计算：",
        "а) $\\sqrt{2^6\\times3^4}$；　б) $\\sqrt{5^4\\times2^6}$；",
        "в) $\\sqrt{\\frac{3^2\\times5^6}{10^4}}$；　г) $\\sqrt{\\frac{7^2}{2^6\\times5^4}}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
